window.products.push({"id":1029069,"name":"Orange LED Display Automatic Soap Dispenser, Touchless Infrared Motion Sensor Stainless Steel Auto Hand Soap Dispenser, Hands Free Soap Dispenser for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LtZ81oXqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why you choose Orange LED Display hands free soap dispenser ?Uses a hands free Infra-Red sensor to avoid the across infrection and protect your familybetter in this special time. ?Durable and long ,It is a intimate gift for your family. Specification 1Size:8.3*3.5*3.5 inches 2Weight: 1 b 3Material: Stainless steel shell,nylon inner sheel 4Product capacity: 250 ml capacity 5Battery type:4×1.5 V AAA 6Color:Black,Golden,Silver,Grey,Stainless steel 7Liquid discharge mode:infrared induction liquid discharge 8Waterproof rating 9Sensor distance:1.2-2 inches 10Input voltage: DC6V 11Power: 1.8W Packing Included 2 x Automatic Soap Dispenser 1 x User Manual 1 x Package Box HOW TO USE 1.Insert 4 x new AAA batteries into the bottom compartment. 2.Unlock the top cover by twisting it anti-clockwise. 3. Use a funnel to easily pour liquid soap or disinfectant into the dispenser. Hold the top cover tightly. 4. Press the power button to switch on. 5. Press the ON button to start the soap dispenser. 6. Now you can enjoy it by putting your hand under the sensor. Attention 1. Do not wash Automatic Soap Dispenser. Wipe clean with a damp cloth. 2. Please keep the bottom of the automatic soap dispenser dry, do not soak it in water to avoid long-term corrosion and damage the unit 3.Please keep the surface of Automatic Soap Dispenser clean. Wipe the body with mop regularly to avoid long-term corrosion upon the unit. 4. If you pour thick liquid, please add proper diluted water to ensure normal discharge. 5. Please keep the smart infra-red motion sensors clear! 6. Avoid direct sunlight to the infrared panel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LtZ81oXqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orange LED Display","source_asin":"B08Y5BXC99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y5BXC99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y5BXC99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
