window.products.push({"id":1029123,"name":"Revol LES NATURELS SET OF 2 TARTLET PANS - Sesame grey - Rustic eLegant french style: inspired from all the traditional French pastry molds, they will","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aRvR+F6XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tartlets have never looked tastier! The creamy or sesame colors of these two tart pans will perfectly cook your best fruity and savory recipes. Their design offers an easy grip, a cooked-through dessert that is yet crispy on the outside, and a beautiful French touch on your table. Coming in a giftbox, Les naturels set of 2 tartlet pans is the perfect gift for your dessert lover friends! Les naturels is a collection specially designed for pastry and baking! All pieces come in creamy white or sesame grey color and they have a beautiful hound’s-tooth finish that reinforces the natural non-stick characteristic of the pans. Made of culinary porcelain, a noble and healthy material, molded and glazed in Revol’s factory, in the heart of St-Uze, each dish is suitable to make homemade pies, sumptuous clafoutis, sweet or savory cakes, moist madeleines, airy soufflés: eight different dishes to execute delicious recipes that have a traditional feel in a high-performing material. SERVING SUGGESTIONS: fruit pies, fruit tarts, savory quiches, flan","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aRvR+F6XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REVOL","source_asin":"B01BMIA6KC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BMIA6KC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BMIA6KC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1029124,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Fido Storage Jar with Copper Lid, 17 Oz (Pack of 6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZRH720umL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fine tradition of the Bormioli Rocco Group coincides with the very history of glass: the first glassworks was established in Parma in 1825. The company has always demonstrated a great drive to pioneer innovation: in machinery, materials and design. Over the years it has developed a special talent, that of combining time-honored craftsmanship and the passion of master glassmakers with modern industrial processes. Bormioli Rocco is the leading company in its sector in Italy and a great ambassador of the Made in Italy label on international markets. Respect for tradition, passion for good taste and constant research and innovation are Bormioli Rocco's milestones to create products that meet the needs of the consumers. For Bormioli Rocco the respect for the environment; it's a must so its entire manufacturing process is oriented towards a mission of social and environmental responsibility. Bormioli Rocco Fido Storage Jars have an airtight bail and seal closures that hermetically seal out air and moisture. Attractive copper metallic top makes storing food stylish. From freezer to countertop, the storage jars are perfect for dry, fresh or leftover foods. They're also great as gift containers for homemade delicacies. Set of 6. Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZRH720umL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B0728NN4QW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0728NN4QW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0728NN4QW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
