window.products.push({"id":1029172,"name":"Dyson 307173-01 Air Blade V HU02-W-LV Hand Dryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":949.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mQoXKmbmL.jpg","description":"The newly re-engineered Air blade \"V,\" the HU02, is now 30% quieter, but still has a very fast dry time due to an air aperture redesign and reprogrammed v4 motor. Still ADA compliant surface mounted. The innovative back plate design allows the dryer to be detached from the wall for more convenient servicing and filter changes. A proximity capacitive sensor provides more reliable activation when hands are placed near the dryer. Additional Information: Dyson Part No.: 307172-01 (Replaces AB12-N-HV, 307170-01, 304662-01, 301827-01). Power Usage: 208-240V, 50/60Hz, 1400 Watts. Note: This dryer has an operational ceiling of 6,550 feet above sea level.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mQoXKmbmL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dyson","source_asin":"B00CTUMOW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CTUMOW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CTUMOW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1029173,"name":"nambe Frond 5-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set | 18/10 Mirror Stainless Steel Silverware Cutlery Set | Designed for Home Kitchens, Hotel, or Restaur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GHu203+-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Frond's organic shape is a testament to the elegance of nature. Each piece features an angled detail at the bottom of the step and the thickness of the round handle is evident at the cut, which makes a wonderful counterpoint to the especially slim neck. Spice up your table with a beautiful collection of flatware like the Frond Place Settings from Nambe. This 5 Piece setting includes a salad fork, dinner fork, dinner knife, soup spoon, and teaspoon for a full meals worth of flatware. Each piece is forged of 18/10 stainless steel. Stylish and durable, this flatware is guaranteed to hold up to all kinds of meals for any kind of guest. It is dishwasher safe as well for simple clean up. Beautiful, strong, and convenient all in one. Recognized for its award-winning designs for more than 60 years, Nambe’s commitment to timeless beauty, artistic integrity and uncompromising quality is evident in the brand’s collection of serve ware, barware, home décor and gift items. Nambe collaborates with the world’s most esteemed designers to develop products that bring function and style into the home. Package contains (1) Nambe Frond 5-Piece Place Setting. Forged of 18/10 stainless steel. Includes service for 1: salad fork, dinner fork, dinner knife, soup spoon and teaspoon. Dishwasher safe. Transitional Décor Style. Designed by Harry & Camilla in 2007. Amazon.com Absolutely charming to behold as well as hold, Frond flatware will not go unnoticed on the dining table. In keeping with Lou Henry's other flatware patterns for Nambé, this one prominently features the form of the metal, rather than detail or ornamentation. Each round handle, as shapely as a spear of asparagus or slender dogwood twig, tapers from the neck and ends abruptly in a bevel, much like the diagonal cut made by pruning shears. The knife handle features the beveled cut on its side, balanced by one of the most graceful blades ever designed. Oversized spoon bowls add a bit of drama. Perfect for either everyday or special occasion use, Frond is forged of premium, dishwasher-safe 18/10 stainless steel in a brightly polished finish. This single Frond place setting consists of a dinner knife, dinner fork, salad fork, soup spoon, and teaspoon. Nambé was founded in 1951 in a village of the same name in scenic northern New Mexico. From the beginning, the company has focused on hand-producing high-quality, functional items such as metal bowls and trays with great attention to timeless, modern design. Stainless steel, porcelain, and crystal pieces now join Nambé's signature metal-alloy lines, all of which are flawlessly crafted and exceptional as gifts. Nambé has won numerous design awards, has been shown in or recognized by nearly two dozen museums worldwide, and is part of the permanent collections of many prestigious institutions. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 1 place setting. The place setting consists of: dinner knife; dinner fork; salad fork; soup spoon; teaspoon. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GHu203+-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B000VXVCDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VXVCDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VXVCDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
