window.products.push({"id":1029199,"name":"90 PCS - Dried Pampas Grass | 8 Kinds of Dried Flower Gift Box Set | Perfect for Boho Decor Home and Room Décor | Beautiful Gifts for Relatives and We","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fSruC0v2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀EXQUISITE GIFT BOX PACKAGING: Unlike anything else on the market， Our gift box contains 90Pcs dry pampas grass, you can decorate it in multiple vases, and give you 30 extension stems, freely splice the length of the stems according to your needs, you will get: ✔White pampas reeds*10Pcs,✔Brown pampas grass*10Pcs,✔Natural pampas grass*10Pcs,✔Natural wheat stalks *10Pcs,✔Pampas grass flowers*10Pcs,✔Yellow billy balls*5Pcs,✔Small star daisy*20Pcs,✔Dried bunny tail grass*15Pcs 🍀NATURAL HIGH-QUALITY DRIED FLOWERS: The non-toxic and harmless dried pampas grass is made of 100% natural high-quality reed grass, which is 100% hand picked and carefully selected. Move nature into your home authentically. 🍀UNIQUE DECORATION: Our pompous grass are more fluffy than products on the market, so they are beautifully decorated in homes, offices, parties, festivals, and weddings. You can use your creativity to DIY boho decor flower arrangements. 🍀ROMANTIC GIFT: Natural pampas grass is carefully placed in a sturdy gift box to ensure that it is not easily damaged during transportation, and it also adds a sense of luxury. This will be a gift that will move relatives and friends. 🍀SOLVE THE LENGTH PROBLEM: If you think it is too long, you can use scissors to cut the length of the dandelion. If you think it is too short, we have carefully prepared an extension rod suitable for your vase, so you don't need to worry about the length. Please refer to the picture for the operation method. 🍀REMINDER: They are naturally dried pampas grass, so they may fall off when taken out of the gift box. Shedding is normal. You can shake the dandelion grass outside and leave it in the sun for a few hours to make them more fluffy. After putting it in the vase, the fall-off will be very small, without daily care and trimming. If the dried flowers you received are damaged, please contact us and we will solve the problem in time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fSruC0v2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"xiheer","source_asin":"B09MVMHC36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MVMHC36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MVMHC36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
