window.products.push({"id":1029317,"name":"Personalized Custom Dachshund Fleece and Sherpa Throw Blanket for Men Women Kids Babies - Dog Dogs Pet Blankets Perfect for Bedtime Bedding Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HuE2+2IiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED – Create a truly unique and one-of-a-kind fleece throw blanket for yourself or someone you love.  Use the customizing tool to enter your name, their name, a funny saying, or an inside joke.  Whatever you choose, we will take your desired text and create an exclusive product just for you that will ship in three business days or less.  You’ll be snuggled up in no time! SO SNUGGLY – No matter the design or size, these blankets are sure to keep you and your loved ones warm on the coldest days and nights.  Perfect for an afternoon on the couch watching a game or movie, taking on a road trip for a quick snooze in the backseat, or keeping warm at the tailgate party.  This blanket goes where you go, and keeps you warm and cozy while you’re there. SIZE OPTIONS – With our three different size blankets to choose from, there is something for everyone.  The smallest blanket is 30”x40” and is perfect for small children and almost all pets (sorry horses).  The 50”x60” blanket is great for young kids who want to show their unique personality with a bit of personalized fun.  The 60”x80” blanket is just huge, excellent for any adults or children who love to ensconce themselves in fleece on their way to Sleepy Town, USA. WASHABLE – Nothing lasts forever, including a clean blanket.  One day you’re going to have to wash it, and that’s ok!  All blanket sizes are made from 100% washable fleece, and the best part is the custom image will never fade.  Because we use premium dye-sublimation materials in the production process, you can be sure that not only will the material last a lifetime, but the custom print will as well.  After you wash it, you can also put it in the dryer worry free.  Soft and warm, but durable, exactly how a top quality blanket should be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HuE2+2IiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Corner","source_asin":"B07S2C2TY9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S2C2TY9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S2C2TY9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1029318,"name":"Winship Stake and Lath, Inc. Handmade Rustic Distressed Black Wood Crates, Nested Set of 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91O45l150sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each set of At Home on Main’s artisan crafted crates will have a slight variation in size, color and texture from the photo.  These are not a mass-produced item and they have a truly farm house chic look. The bottoms are not painted but are the lovely natural wood hue.   The crates are 3 different sizes and can be nested and stored together.  Perfect for:  Kitchen items such as oils, towels, fruit, cooking utensils Laundry room organization Hanging on the wall in your home or office for small decorative items or succulents  We are a small family owned business, making high quality, organic wood products for 40 years.   All of our packaging and much of our assembly is done by a job training program for special needs adults Our products are entirely made of sustainably forested wood, much of it reclaimed or that would otherwise go to scrap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91O45l150sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winship Stake and Lath, Inc.","source_asin":"B078C81Y1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078C81Y1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078C81Y1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
