window.products.push({"id":1029385,"name":"Sejoy Humidifiers Ultrasonic for Home, Humidifier for Baby, Humidifiers for Bedroom Kids, Humidifiers for Plants-Easy to Clean, Top Fill, Smart Consta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n9Ap1-sJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to Use】: The room humidifiers for large areas has 3-speed atomization adjustment. Top fill is convenient to add water, The touch key setting is easy to operate, and the LED screen display is clear and easy to understand. 4L water tank, long operating time, to meet your life needs. The humidifier for large room provides fast, comfortable relief from the ravages of dry air. 【Quiet Ultrasonic Technology】: The ultrasonic humidifiers for baby advanced ultrasonic mist technology spreads an ultra-fine cool mist, ensuring the moisture stays in the air and humidifying the room in a matter of minutes. The ultrasonic humidifier is quieter than a whisper. 【Smart Constant Humidity】: The intelligent constant humidity mode has seven modes to choose from. The humidity value of 45%RH-80%RH can be set. The sensor detects the humidity near the machine and refreshes it every 1s. The value changes in units of 1% until it reaches the humidity you set. 【7-Color Light ＆ Smart Humidity Monitoring】: The humidifiers for large room equipped with 7 nightlight colors for even more control over the dreamy ambiance. Its ambient light can be operated independently as a night light. After the ultrasonic humidifier is plugged in, the humidifier will automatically start monitoring the ambient humidity value and display it on the LED screen 【Water Shortage Protection】: Turn on the machine in the state of water shortage, the buzzer sounds 5 times, and the digital screen keeps flashing. When the humidifier works until water shortage, the digital screen keeps flashing. Beeps and flashing digital screen will give you a water shortage reminder, it is convenient for you to add water in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n9Ap1-sJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sejoy","source_asin":"B0BX8YM19T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX8YM19T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX8YM19T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
