window.products.push({"id":1029440,"name":"LUFEIJIASHI Recliner Chair Covers Non Slip Waterproof Large Recliner Covers for Leather Recliner,Electric Reclining Chair Covers for Living Room Dog S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818jw4o+w+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CREATIVE DESIG:This recliner furniture covers pattern is based on the pattern of Paisley. recliner slipcovers for recliner chair is woven with jacquard technology, which makes the recliner furniture protectors firm and durable. The pattern is exquisite and three-dimensional, like a beautiful picture scroll.The recliner reversible sofa cover contains: 19.7*27.5-inch armrest cover with side pockets, a 28.7*35.8-inch seat cushion, and a 28.7*35.8-inch backrest section, suitable for most wide recliner chair cover. STRONG NON-SLIP: The backing of the oversized recliner cover is made of soft silicone anti-skid particles, which can provide enough friction to achieve the anti-skid effect, which can ensure that the reclining covers for chair is covered on the recliner made of cloth and leather without displacement or sliding! PREMIUM WATERPROOF:The recliner chair covers for reclining chair made of waterproof fabric has good water resistance, so you don't have to worry about some liquids and stains dirtying the recliner covers for recliner chair, not only that, this waterproof recliner cover can also prevent cats, dogs and pets' claws from harming the furniture, which can protect Extended service life of furniture. MULTIPLE SIDE POCKETS:Recliner Cover with Pockets has 2 large pockets and 3 small pockets on both sides of the armrest for storing daily magazines, newspapers, remote controls and other essentials that are placed on the massage chair cover protector, saving you from buying extra storage Expenses for armrest covers. At the same time, the chair covers for living room also protects the armrests of the recliner slip covers for recliner chair from the wear and tear of daily use. EASY TO CLEAN AND INSTALL:The design of the chair covers for recliners is more user-friendly, and each part can be installed and removed separately, which completely solves the troublesome problem of traditional cover for recliner chair installation. At the same time, the lazy boy recliner chair covers is also very easy to clean, just machine wash the stained part, and if there is food residue or pet hair, you can also use a vacuum cleaner to clean it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818jw4o+w+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUFEIJIASHI","source_asin":"B0B2R58DRR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2R58DRR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2R58DRR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1029441,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Sunset Beach II no Orange by Silvia Vassileva, 35x35","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tM0w6dumL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a horizon of grey, white, teal, and blue paint streaks. Prominent colors: white, light blue, blue, teal Silvia Vassileva pursued her love of art at the Academy of fine art in Bulgaria, where she earned both her bachelor's and master's degrees. She spent six years painting and exhibiting her work in Japan before moving to the U.S. Silvia describes her style as very free and bold. She makes her paintings come alive by using contrast and unusual color palettes. Silvia's home studio, which she designed herself, is bright, contemporary and minimalist. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tM0w6dumL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07NFKBXG3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NFKBXG3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NFKBXG3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
