window.products.push({"id":1029710,"name":"Crystalware, Beverage Paper Napkins, 1 Ply Cocktail Napkin, Bulk Package, White (4,000 Napkins)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R8KruIJeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"White Beverage Napkins by Crystalware These White 1-Ply Beverage Napkins add a crisp and polished appearance to any table setting. They great single-ply napkins, giving them maximum durability and absorbability. They are perfect for use with a variety of beverages such as cocktails, juice, coffee, or tea. They are disposable, they minimize clean up and are an affordable alternative to coasters or saucers. Able to protect tabletops and other surfaces from condensation on glasses, while keeping your hands dry, these napkins are perfect for any culinary occasion and are the perfect size with folded dimensions of 4.75\" x 4.75\".Product Features• FOR ALL BEVERAGES: Serve with any beverage, such as water, juice, coffee, tea, or cocktails. Suitable for in the hospitality industry, and these napkins are perfect for bars, coffee shops, and restaurants, or events• DISPOSABLE AND CONVENIENT: As a one-time use item, these napkins offer convenience and time savings by eliminating the need to wash fabric napkins• SOLID WHITE: Impress guests with stylish and put together place settings. These white beverage napkins bring an elegant and classic appearance to any table setting• PROTECT SURFACES: Using a beverage napkin underneath your glasses will help prevent condensation from running onto bars, tabletops or table cloths • PERFECTLY SIZED: At 4.75 Inches when folded they fit neatly into most bar caddiesWhat customers are saying about the Crystalware Beverage napkins “Great price for so many napkins! They are perfect for any occasion. Not too thin, just right. Very happy with this purchase...”Kristin","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R8KruIJeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystalware","source_asin":"B0746BLPRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0746BLPRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0746BLPRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
