window.products.push({"id":1029728,"name":"JMiles UH-BH253 Wall Mounted Wine Bottle Storage and Display Rack Holder Horizontal Wine Bottle Rack for Home or Restaurant Holds 6 Bottles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zw1wF+OoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The JMiles UH-BH253-BLK Wall-Mounted Wine Bottle Rack is an ideal way to store Six bottles of your favorite wine, whether it's used for display or for temporary storage of wine you plan to enjoy. Made from powder coated tubular steel, the rack is more than strong enough to be used for long-term bottle storage, and as it holds wine bottles with their corks angled slightly downward, it will prevent the accidental spoilage that can occur when wines are stored upright. It installs with just two screws, though wall anchors are recommended for most surfaces. The rack's minimalist design draws almost no attention whether it is empty or holding one, two, or its full complement of three wine bottles. Instead, the unit puts the bottles themselves on full display, making it easy to view the labels and appreciate the handsome tableau created by wine bottles perched prominently on the wall of your home, restaurant, tavern, or retail location. The UH-BH253-BLK is a great choice for creating a permanent decoration for a home or restaurant, but thanks to the ease of placement and retrieval of the wine bottles, it's also a perfect choice for a location where wine is served regularly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zw1wF+OoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J Miles Co.","source_asin":"B074MLCL2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074MLCL2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074MLCL2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
