window.products.push({"id":1029907,"name":"MOPALL Bathroom Trash Can - 3.5 Gallon Automatic Trash Can,Waterproof Slim Touchless Bathroom Garbage Can with a Lid(White with Gold Trim)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711ykcRe5BL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"😎【Best Trash Can for Bathroom】The Automatic Trash Can unique contour design improves the appearance of the product.The golden trim is refracted in the light and shadow, showing fashion and luxury.durable ABS materials. Ideal for bathroom use.Of course, this motion sensor trash can is also very suitable for bedroom,kitchen,living room.Light luxury color design (White Gold), not only a smart bathroom trash can, but more like a work of art.Also one of your housewarming gift options. 🚮【Touchless Garbage Can】The automatic trash can have two ways to open the lid.runs on 2 AA batteries（no include）The cover for installing the battery is made of silicone material to protect your fingernails.infrared induction, quick opening in 0.3 seconds. wave-sensing touch-free trash can, one-key normally open lid for easy use. Knee bending induction avoids bending, saving time and effort. When you need to open, just gently place your knees on the 8-inch sensing area above the trash can. 🌎【Advanced Technology】Advanced IPX5 waterproof technology prevents water or humid environment from damaging the unit. Leaving none water stain on surface after rinse. 🍀【Ease and Convenient】Removable ring liner holds trash bag sturdy in place and prevents bag from overhanging for a neat and clean appearance.we recommend using 4gallon garbage bags.they don't slip and are completely hidden. ✍️【Important Note】Please install 2 AA batteries before using this induction automatic trash can.as well as follow the steps to put on the garbage bag to ensure the bin works properly. Then you need to press the button on the lid for more than 3 seconds to start it. you can wave your hand or bend your knees to open the lid. 😉【Perfect Odorless Trash Can】Excellent seal, you will never have to put up with unpleasant odors again!We all hate bad smells coming out of the trash after all. This 3.5 gallon automatic trash can has a perfect seal, prevents odor from spilling, and is the best choice for bathroom/kitchen/bedroom/office/restroom/rv/dorm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711ykcRe5BL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOPALL","source_asin":"B0BR6G864T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1029907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR6G864T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR6G864T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
